codenet_891.java_algorithm:
function main(r, g, b, n):
    result = 0
    for i from 0 to n:
        for j from 0 to n:
            if i == 0 and j == 0 and n % b == 0:
                result += 1
            else if i*r + j*g == n:
                result += 1
            else if n - (i*r + j*g) > 0 and (n - (i*r + j*g)) % b == 0:
                result += 1
    return result

codenet_786.java_algorithm:
Read input N
Initialize min = infinity
for a = 1 to sqrt(N):
    if N % a == 0:
        b = N / a
        if (a - 1) + (b - 1) < min:
            min = (a - 1) + (b - 1)
Output min

